    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d258-a1">

                <pb facs="0367" n="247" xml:id="pg247"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs to Chargé
                        Snyder.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Republic of Colombia,<lb/>Ministry for Foreign
                                Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Bogotá</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-06-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June 30, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In your note of the 29th of this month your
                    honor has seen fit to transmit to me a telegram from the alcalde of Segovia,
                    Department of Antioquia, informing you that Joseff Otto, citizen of the United
                    States, was murdered on the 11th of said month.</p>
                <p>By telegram of this date the government of Antioquia has been ordered to take
                    summary measures, if they have not already been taken, against those responsible
                    for the crime, and that the necessary measures be taken in accordance with the
                    law and consular convention between this Republic and the United States, to
                    place in security the effects left by the deceased; and that information be
                    given to this office of all the circumstances of the case in order that they may
                    be forwarded to your honor.</p>
                <p>I improve, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clímaco Calderón.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
